One heading only. Cloth and slight bell proportions are visually coherent rather than rig-locked. Exact projection, physical height, engine timing/hitboxes, mirroring, gameplay-scale read and separate VFX remain unvalidated. No generative retry or cascading edit was used: each sheet was generated fresh from original identity and camera references.
